       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. DARTS.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-X PIC 99V9.
       01 WS-Y PIC 99V9.
       01 WS-RESULT PIC 99.
       01 WS-SQUARE PIC 999V9.
       
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       DARTS.
         COMPUTE WS-SQUARE = WS-X * WS-X + WS-Y * WS-Y
         IF 100 < WS-SQUARE
            MOVE 0 TO WS-RESULT
         ELSE IF 25 <= WS-SQUARE
            MOVE 1 TO WS-RESULT
         ELSE IF 1 < WS-SQUARE
            MOVE 5 TO WS-RESULT
         ELSE 
            MOVE 10 TO WS-RESULT
         END-IF.
